---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import AppHeader from '@/components/AppHeader.astro';
import AppFooter from '@/components/AppFooter.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'November 12, 2025';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Awesome Directories"
  description="Privacy Policy for Awesome Directories - Learn how we collect, use, and protect your data."
>
  <AppHeader />

  <main class="min-h-screen bg-gray-50 py-12">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-600 mb-8">Last Updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-gray-700">
        <div class="card p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">
            Our Commitment to Privacy
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-4">
            Awesome Directories is an open-source project that respects your
            privacy. We collect minimal data necessary to provide our service
            and never sell your personal information to third parties.
          </p>
          <p>
            This privacy policy explains what data we collect, how we use it,
            and your rights regarding your personal information. As an
            open-source project, we prioritize transparency and user control.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">
            1. Information We Collect
          </h2>

          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3 mt-6">
            1.1 Authentication Data (via Supabase)
          </h3>
          <p class="mb-3">When you create an account using OAuth authentication, we collect:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 mb-4 pl-4">
            <li>Email address - From your Google or GitHub account</li>
            <li>OAuth provider ID - Unique identifier from Google or GitHub</li>
            <li>Display name/username - Public profile information</li>
            <li>Profile picture - Avatar from your OAuth provider (if available)</li>
            <li>Account creation date - Timestamp of when you first signed up</li>
          </ul>

          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3 mt-6">
            1.2 User-Generated Content
          </h3>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 mb-4 pl-4">
            <li>Directory submissions - Information you submit about new directories</li>
            <li>Favorites - Directories you've marked as favorites</li>
            <li>Votes - Your upvotes or downvotes on directories</li>
            <li>Reviews & comments - Your written feedback about directories</li>
            <li>Submission tracking - Record of your directory submissions</li>
          </ul>

          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3 mt-6">
            1.3 Analytics Data (via Pirsch)
          </h3>
          <p class="mb-3">
            We collect anonymized analytics data through Pirsch, a privacy-first analytics platform:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 mb-4 pl-4">
            <li>Page views - Which pages you visit</li>
            <li>Referrer information - Where you came from</li>
            <li>Browser & device type - General device information</li>
            <li>Geographic location - Country-level location (not precise)</li>
            <li>Session duration - How long you spend on the site</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="bg-blue-50 border-l-4 border-blue-400 p-4 mb-4">
            <strong>Important:</strong> Pirsch is fully GDPR-compliant and does NOT use cookies or track personal information. All analytics data is anonymized and aggregated. No IP addresses are stored.
          </p>

          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3 mt-6">
            1.4 Newsletter Data (via Mautic)
          </h3>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 mb-4 pl-4">
            <li>Email address - To send you updates and launch strategies</li>
            <li>Subscription source - Where you signed up (e.g., footer, popup)</li>
            <li>Subscription date - When you subscribed</li>
            <li>Email engagement - Whether you open or click links in our emails</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="card p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">
            2. How We Use Your Information
          </h2>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 pl-4">
            <li>Provide core features - Authentication, favorites, submissions, voting</li>
            <li>Improve the service - Understand usage patterns and optimize UX</li>
            <li>Send newsletters - Deliver launch strategies and updates (opt-in only)</li>
            <li>Prevent abuse - Detect and prevent spam or malicious activity</li>
            <li>Communicate updates - Notify you of important changes</li>
            <li>Comply with legal obligations - Respond to valid legal requests</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-4 font-semibold">
            We do NOT: Sell your data, share it with advertisers, or use it for unrelated purposes.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">
            3. Data Storage & Security
          </h2>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 pl-4">
            <li>Encryption - All data is transmitted over HTTPS (TLS/SSL)</li>
            <li>OAuth authentication - We never store passwords</li>
            <li>Database security - Supabase implements row-level security</li>
            <li>Access controls - Limited access to production data</li>
            <li>Regular updates - Dependencies kept up to date</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="card p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">
            4. Your Privacy Rights
          </h2>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 pl-4 mb-4">
            <li>Access - Request a copy of your data</li>
            <li>Correction - Request corrections to inaccurate data</li>
            <li>Deletion - Request deletion of your account and data</li>
            <li>Portability - Request data in machine-readable format</li>
            <li>Opt-out - Unsubscribe from newsletters anytime</li>
            <li>Revoke access - Disconnect OAuth via Google/GitHub settings</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="font-semibold">How to Exercise Your Rights:</p>
          <p>Email: <a href="mailto:privacy@awesome-directories.com" class="text-primary hover:underline">privacy@awesome-directories.com</a></p>
        </div>

        <div class="card p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">
            5. Open Source Transparency
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-4">As an open-source project, we believe in transparency. You can:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 pl-4">
            <li>Review our source code - See exactly how we handle data on GitHub</li>
            <li>Audit our practices - Verify our privacy claims in the codebase</li>
            <li>Contribute improvements - Submit PRs to enhance privacy features</li>
            <li>Report concerns - Open issues for privacy-related questions</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="card p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">
            6. Contact Us
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-4">
            If you have questions, concerns, or requests regarding this privacy
            policy or your personal data, please contact us:
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2">
            <li>Privacy Email: <a href="mailto:privacy@awesome-directories.com" class="text-primary hover:underline">privacy@awesome-directories.com</a></li>
            <li>General Contact: <a href="mailto:contact@awesome-directories.com" class="text-primary hover:underline">contact@awesome-directories.com</a></li>
            <li>GitHub Issues: <a href="https://github.com/awesome-directories/awesome-directories/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-primary hover:underline">awesome-directories/awesome-directories</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="card p-8 bg-blue-50 border-blue-200">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">TL;DR Summary</h3>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 pl-4">
            <li>We collect minimal data (email, OAuth info, usage data)</li>
            <li>We use privacy-first analytics (Pirsch) with no cookies</li>
            <li>We never sell your data or share it with advertisers</li>
            <li>You can request access, correction, or deletion anytime</li>
            <li>Our code is open-source, so you can verify our practices</li>
            <li>We're transparent, community-driven, and respect your privacy</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <AppFooter />
</BaseLayout>
